	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia et pax a domino nostro Iesu Christo.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Etsi variis iisque gravibus negotiis nunc temporis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>sum et in schola et ecclesia distentus, vir doctissime, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>fecit tamen non modo humanitas tua, quam ex primis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ad me literis insignem perspexi, verum etiam <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>occasio tabellariorum<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Die beiden <persName ref="p8514">Vulteius</persName>-Brüder; s. unten.</note>, ut non potuerim intermittere, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quin tibi vel amicitiae ergo aliquid scriberem, ne <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>me prorsus tui et tuorum fratrum immemorem pu<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tares.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Deus pater hucusque inimicis crucis propter <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>peccata nostra triumphum ut amplum ita <foreign xml:lang="el">ἀπροσδ<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>όκητον</foreign><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="13">unerwartet, unvermutet.</note> concessit, quem eundem spero ut cito factum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ita atque adeo citius periturum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="de">Amen.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Unde nos ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Christi ministri ab imperito vulgo pessime audimus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>et Vatiniano odio<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Vatiniano odio: Zitat aus einem Gedicht des römischen Dichters Catull (Carmina, 14, 3), welches adressiert ist an Catulls Freund Calvus, der sich infolge mehrerer Anzeigen gegen den Politiker <persName ref="p6901">Publius Vatinius</persName> dessen Hass zugezogen hatte. Vgl. auch <bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl> 2, 2, 94 (<bibl>ASD</bibl> II/3 206, <ref target="file11237">Nr. 1194</ref>).</note> laboramus1</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Saepe est mihi haec <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>vox obtrecta</foreign>: "Es wirt nicht gut, man hencke dan <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>die pfaffen<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Damit ist sowohl die protestantische als auch die katholische Geistlichkeit gemeint.</note> alle" etc.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quibus respondi ex historia Iudaeo<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>rum idem Caipham cum reliqua Iudaeorum turba contra Christum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>molitam esse; verum, ut illi ob hoc ipsum, quod Christum, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>filium dei, et apostolos trucidarunt, et locum<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Jerusalem.</note> et templum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>amiserunt, ita vobiscum quoque agetur nobis deletis.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Ditissimi quique hinc non tantum sua bona in vicina <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>episcopi <persName ref="p7548">Moguntini</persName><note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17"><persName ref="p7548">Sebastian von Heusenstamm</persName>.</note> oppida removent, verum etiam istaru<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>m civitatum ius magno aere redimunt idque nesciente <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>principe nostro<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Landgraf <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ex quo ipse sum commotus zelo dei <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>libellum<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">An, et quatenus Christianis sit fugiendum, duo tractatus, <placeName ref="l311">Marburg</placeName> 1547 (<bibl source="https://gateway-bayern.de/VD16+T+679">VD16 T679</bibl>).</note> de fuga conscribere, in quo contendo <foreign xml:lang="el">καθόλως</foreign><note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">überhaupt; ganz und gar.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>christianis non esse fugiendum, maxime ad papistas <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>impios, qui de nobis et nostro adventu triumphum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>agunt, perinde ac si non modo pedibus, sed etiam sententia <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ad istos concessissemus; quod deus a nobis diu avertat!<pb type="scan" next="v."/></s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Hunc libellum tibi transmitto rogans, ut sententiam tuam libere <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>mihi rescribas, qua re nihil certe potes mihi facere gratius.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Illustrissimus princeps spiritu dei patris per Iesum Christum <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>iterum excitatus est et armis telisque se instruit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Audio <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>proxima hepdomade <foreign xml:lang="el">ἐκπορευούμενον καὶ ἐπισκόπων τῶν τοῦ ἀντιχρί<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>στου ἀγγέλων</foreign>.<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Ich höre, dass er nächste Woche zu den Bischöfen, den Gesandten des Antichristen, abreisen wird. - Gemeint sind die Bischöfe der an den Rhein grenzenden Bistümer: Köln (<persName ref="p18420">Adolf III. von Schaumburg</persName>), Mainz (Sebastian von Heusenstamm), Trier (seit 20. April 1547: Johann V. von Isenburg).</note></s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Deus det, ut sit in <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>aedificationem ecclesiae et gloriam nominis sui.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Amen.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Nos paramus equum, deus largitur benedictionem.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Hoc tamen firmiter credo eum suam ecclesiam non deserturum.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z10"/>In tempus hic affligit, ut in secula aeterna nos<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> non.</note> consoletur<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Kor 1, 6</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Nihil novi est hic nisi triste de caesaris<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> tyrannide.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z12"/>Commendo tibi hosce duos adulescentes<note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24">Johannes und <persName ref="p8457">Justus Vulteius</persName>.</note>, quamquam nihil dubitem <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>eos sicut omnes studiosos et religione et naturali vita <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>tibi commendatos.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div8" corresp="regest8">
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta <persName ref="p8011">Waltherum</persName><note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25">Gwalther.</note> et <persName ref="p8459">Ottonem</persName><note xml:id="fn26" type="footnote" n="26"><persName ref="p8459">Otto Werdmüller</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>et tuam<note xml:id="fn27" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="27"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> et illorum uxores<note xml:id="fn28" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="28"><persName ref="p5081">Regula Gwalther, geb. Zwingli</persName>, und <persName ref="p7013">Magdalena Werdmüller, geb. Gessner</persName> (s. <bibl source="b14">HBBW XI</bibl> 100, Anm. 8).</note>.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Si <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandro</persName> et aliis fratribus <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>gratum foret, idem ab ignoto illis referres meis verbis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Datae <placeName ref="l311">Marpurgi</placeName>, die 27. aprilis anno etc. 47.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z18"/><persName ref="p3138">Theobaldus Thamerus</persName>,</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/>tuus ex toto animo frater <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>in domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Pietate iuxta ac doctrina <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>spectato viro domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, sacrae theologiae professori <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>et <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae antistiti, <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>domino ac fratri in domino suo <lb xml:id="p4z6"/>charissimo.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p4z7"/>Zürch.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
